{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不順有相不依無相即是\n見法。見法者見本性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不依有見無見\n即是不依正見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若人不求種種世法。亦不求\n\n佛法。即是真求法人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "識心見性悟理之人即是真佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離有離無故。不垢不\n淨故。無生無體故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "實相者。不順有體相不依無相是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若不識心\n不見性總無寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見性之人三寶具足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不隨有行不依無行即是離法之人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是佛寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是法寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是僧寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除見性外更有法門出三界得成佛者無有是處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因犯禁戒制戒是。此戒是方便戒。是不了教。只許五歲學五歲若不捨是真外道。是具足邪見人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切眾生本來自有佛性。是持真戒者識心見性人。是見性之時想念不生。不起分別及有漏習。入無戒\n不自不他不垢不淨無我無人無念無分別無主無宰無悋無惜百無所須。諸欲永息等同虛空。同無情物身心不自。\n戒犯不二能。如是知者是真持戒人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一部一卷成。亦名轉女身菩薩問答經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛弟子終有為著相。非沙門法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經者即此心。是不生不滅故。不垢不淨故。離有離無\n故。影體俱離故。不依性相故。亦不順生。亦不依寂。亦不順有相。亦不依無相不沈不浮故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無憶無念者即不順浮。亦無墮落者。即不沈空滯寂。此\n法不順有心。不依無心。順有心者即是波浪。依無心者即是□□空見外道有無不二即是正見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0945_p0141c28"}
{"id": null, "n": "1193001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1193001", "type": "mod", "text": "間【大】，間月【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1195001", "type": "mod", "text": "身【大】，者【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1195002", "type": "mod", "text": "上【大】，尚【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1196001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1196001", "type": "mod", "text": "間【大】，門【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1197001", "type": "mod", "text": "溢【大】＊，逸【考偽-大】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1197002", "type": "mod", "text": "於心【大】，心意【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1192001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1192001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】大谷大學藏燉煌本，首題新加"}
{"id": null, "n": "1192002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1192002", "type": "orig", "text": "首缺"}
{"id": null, "n": "1193001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1193001", "type": "orig", "text": "間＋（月）？"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1195001", "type": "orig", "text": "身＝者？"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1195002", "type": "orig", "text": "上＝尚？"}
{"id": null, "n": "1196001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1196001", "type": "orig", "text": "間＝門？"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1197001", "type": "orig", "text": "溢＝逸？＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1197002", "type": "orig", "text": "於心＝心意？"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1197003", "type": "orig", "text": "已下斷缺"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195a1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_1195a1501", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1195a2001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_1195a2001", "type": "add", "text": "一【CB】，【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1197a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_1197a0101", "type": "add", "text": "塵【CB】，鹿【大】"}
